					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-395742#post-1269405</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-395742/game-day#post-1269405</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 28 Sep 2011 23:20:32 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Gears</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>172464</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm already in this hairball, but let me make a little note as well, for the old fogies: Now would be a good time to try out the road less traveled. I like my avatar, and don't mind at all that he's going to be off the main stage for this story, however I'm still going to worm my way in to the main narrative. A idea for an Agent, along with some less savory characters, who i haven't been able to use in other works may be making an appearance.</p> <p>This may not appeal to the newer folks, but for some, your tried-and-true persona may be feeling a little&#8230;stale. I think this kind of this is the perfect time to shake things up some.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
